START

Read infix expression
Set top = -1

FOR/WHILE each character:

    IF operand
        Add to postfix

    ELSE IF '('
        PUSH

    ELSE IF ')'
        POP until '('
        Remove '('

    ELSE operator
        WHILE stack top has higher/equal priority
            POP and add to postfix
        PUSH operator

    Move to next character

END WHILE

POP all remaining operators
Add NULL to postfix

Display postfix

STOP
